{"title":"Jul 26 — Departure","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Jul 26 — Departure"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Sunday · July 26, 2026 · Day 1 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Departure ✈️</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Vancouver International Airport (YVR) → Incheon (ICN)</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-jul26\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-jul26').setView([49.1947, -123.1784], 12);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  var mYVR = L.marker([49.1947, -123.1784], { icon: dot('#C62828') }).addTo(map);\n  mYVR.bindPopup('<b>Vancouver International Airport</b><br>Terminal: International<br><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Vancouver+International+Airport\" target=\"_blank\">Open in Maps →</a>');\n  window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: mYVR, lat: 49.1947, lng: -123.1784 });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Before You Leave — Pre-Departure Checklist</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" style=\"border-color:#F9A825\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">Jul 23</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag note\">📋 3 Days Before</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Fill Out Korea e-Arrival Card</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Korean immigration requires an electronic arrival card submitted up to 3 days before arrival. Complete it at <a href=\"https://www.e-arrivalcard.go.kr\" target=\"_blank\">e-arrivalcard.go.kr</a>. Have your passport, flight number, and accommodation address (Shilla Stay Seodaemun) ready. Saves significant time at immigration on arrival.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.e-arrivalcard.go.kr\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">🌐 e-arrivalcard.go.kr</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" style=\"border-color:#42A5F5\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">Jul 24–25</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag note\">✈️ 24–48 hrs Before</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Online Check-In</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Check in online with your airline to choose seats and download boarding passes. Most airlines open check-in 24 hours before departure. Having mobile boarding passes avoids a queue at the airport.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" style=\"border-color:#66BB6A\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">Tonight</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag note\">🎒 Packing List</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Packing List</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">\n      <strong>Documents</strong>\n      <ul>\n        <li>✅ Passport (valid 6+ months)</li>\n        <li>✅ Korea e-Arrival Card (completed)</li>\n      </ul>\n      <strong>Electronics</strong>\n      <ul>\n        <li>✅ Phone + charger</li>\n        <li>✅ Universal adapter (Korea uses Type C/F, 220V)</li>\n        <li>✅ Portable charger / power bank</li>\n        <li>✅ Camera + memory cards</li>\n        <li>✅ Earbuds / headphones (for flight)</li>\n      </ul>\n      <strong>Clothing</strong>\n      <ul>\n        <li>✅ Light layers (summer in Korea is hot &amp; humid, ~28–33°C)</li>\n        <li>✅ Rain jacket / compact umbrella (summer is monsoon season)</li>\n        <li>✅ Comfortable walking shoes (cobblestone streets at palaces)</li>\n        <li>✅ Smart casual outfit for nicer dinners</li>\n        <li>✅ Light jacket for cave (Manjanggul is 11°C inside)</li>\n      </ul>\n      <strong>Health &amp; Toiletries</strong>\n      <ul>\n        <li>✅ Sunscreen (SPF 50+ — Korea summer sun is intense)</li>\n        <li>✅ Medications + any prescriptions</li>\n        <li>✅ Lip balm, hand cream (plane is dry)</li>\n      </ul>\n      <strong>Money &amp; Cards</strong>\n      <ul>\n        <li>✅ Korean Won cash (₩200,000–300,000 for first day)</li>\n        <li>✅ Credit card with no foreign transaction fees</li>\n      </ul>\n      <strong>Miscellaneous</strong>\n      <ul>\n        <li>✅ Neck pillow + eye mask (overnight flight)</li>\n        <li>✅ Snacks for the flight</li>\n        <li>✅ Reusable water bottle</li>\n        <li>✅ Tote bag (for shopping / day trips)</li>\n        <li>✅ Small daypack for hikes (Seongsan, DMZ)</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Departure</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card transport\" data-dt=\"2026-07-26T13:00\" data-lat=\"49.1947\" data-lng=\"-123.1784\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">13:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\">\n      <span class=\"tag transport\">✈️ Departure</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Depart Vancouver (YVR)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">International terminal. Arrive at least 3 hours early for international check-in. Korea Air / Air Canada routing to ICN. Cross the International Date Line — arrive July 27.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Vancouver+International+Airport\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 YVR Airport</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section-header\">Evening / Overnight</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card transport\" style=\"border-color:#7986CB\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">—</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag transport\">✈️ In-Flight</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Overnight flight to Seoul (ICN)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Flight time ~11 hours. Gain 16 hours crossing the date line. Arrive Seoul the next day (Jul 27) at 16:05 KST.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card activity\" style=\"border-color:#5C6BC0;background:#F8F8FF\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">💤</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">😴 Jet Lag Strategy</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">In-Flight Sleep Plan — Reset to KST</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">\n      Vancouver → Seoul crosses <strong>16 time zones eastward</strong> — the tougher direction. The goal is to land at 16:05 KST feeling functional, then push through to 21:00 KST bedtime. Follow this flight plan:\n      <div style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0\">\n\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 12px;background:#EDE7F6;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;border-left:4px solid #7E57C2\">\n            <div style=\"min-width:100px;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;color:#4527A0\">13:00–15:00 PDT<br><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:#7E57C2\">05:00–07:00 KST</span></div>\n            <div><strong>Stay awake</strong> — it's afternoon for your body. Eat the meal service, watch a movie, get settled.</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 12px;background:#E8EAF6;border-left:4px solid #3F51B5\">\n            <div style=\"min-width:100px;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;color:#1A237E\">15:00–15:30 PDT<br><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:#5C6BC0\">07:00–07:30 KST</span></div>\n            <div><strong>Wind down</strong> — take melatonin (0.5–1mg low dose works best), put on eye mask and neck pillow, recline seat.</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 12px;background:#E3F2FD;border-left:4px solid #1565C0\">\n            <div style=\"min-width:100px;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;color:#0D47A1\">15:30–22:00 PDT<br><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:#1565C0\">07:30–14:00 KST</span></div>\n            <div><strong>😴 SLEEP</strong> — aim for ~6 hours. This is the critical window. Even if it feels unnatural (your body says it's afternoon), use the eye mask, earplugs, and blanket. Avoid checking the time.</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 12px;background:#E8F5E9;border-left:4px solid #2E7D32\">\n            <div style=\"min-width:100px;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;color:#1B5E20\">22:00–00:05 PDT<br><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:#2E7D32\">14:00–16:05 KST</span></div>\n            <div><strong>Wake up</strong> — ~2 hrs before landing. Freshen up, eat the pre-landing meal, open the window shade, get into Seoul headspace. ☀️</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 12px;background:#FFF9C4;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;border-left:4px solid #F9A825\">\n            <div style=\"min-width:100px;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;color:#E65100\">16:05 KST<br><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:#F9A825\">00:05 PDT</span></div>\n            <div><strong>Land in Seoul</strong> — your body thinks it's midnight, but it's 4pm in Korea. The plan from here is on the Jul 27 page. 🇰🇷</div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:#777\">💊 <strong>Melatonin tip:</strong> low dose (0.5mg) taken 30 min before your target sleep time works better than the standard 5mg pill. Available at Shoppers Drug Mart before the flight.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>Tip:</strong> T-money transit card comes free with your LG U+ SIM — pick up the SIM at Gate A, T1 Arrivals right after landing.</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Sunday · July 26, 2026 · Day 1 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Departure ✈️</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Vancouver International Airport (YVR) → Incheon (ICN)</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-jul26\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-jul26').setView([49.1947, -123.1784], 12);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  var mYVR = L.marker([49.1947, -123.1784], { icon: dot('#C62828') }).addTo(map);\n  mYVR.bindPopup('<b>Vancouver International Airport</b><br>Terminal: International<br><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Vancouver+International+Airport\" target=\"_blank\">Open in Maps →</a>');\n  window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: mYVR, lat: 49.1947, lng: -123.1784 });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Before You Leave — Pre-Departure Checklist</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" style=\"border-color:#F9A825\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">Jul 23</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag note\">📋 3 Days Before</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Fill Out Korea e-Arrival Card</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Korean immigration requires an electronic arrival card submitted up to 3 days before arrival. Complete it at <a href=\"https://www.e-arrivalcard.go.kr\" target=\"_blank\">e-arrivalcard.go.kr</a>. Have your passport, flight 